{"seq":2,"slug":"action-item-economics-tracking","title":"行动项经济学与闭环跟踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/sre-incident-command-response/postmortem-learning-governance/action-item-economics-tracking","wordCount":2662,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"行动项经济学与闭环跟踪\">行动项经济学与闭环跟踪</h1><p>一次事故复盘最容易被浪费的环节，不是开会，而是会后。会议当天人人点头，工单系统里多出十几条「加强监控」「完善文档」，三个月后其中大半仍未关闭，而下一次同类故障照常发生。Google SRE 工作手册用一句话给这个现象定了上限：Ben Treynor Sloss 说，「a postmortem without subsequent action is indistinguishable from no postmortem」——没有后续行动的复盘，与根本没有复盘无法区分（<a href=\"https://sre.google/workbook/postmortem-culture/\">Google SRE Workbook</a>）。反过来也成立：若行动项本身没有闭环机制，它就只是一份写给人看的清单。本文处理两个连在一起的问题——行动项该怎么定价（经济学），以及它们该怎么被跟踪到关闭（闭环）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把复盘产出当成投资组合\">核心概念：把复盘产出当成投资组合</h2><p>把复盘行动的默认假设——「列出的行动项越多越好」——拆开看，会发现它假设了资源无限。真实约束是：一个团队一个季度能投入的工程容量是常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，每关闭一条行动项消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而每条行动项买到的是「该故障类别复发概率下降」这一不确定收益。于是「多列」与「列得准」必然冲突，裁决方式是投资组合视角，而非清单长度。</p>\n<p>单条行动项的期望价值可以写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>EV</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>recur</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>loss</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EV}(a) = P_{\\text{recur}} \\cdot I_{\\text{loss}} \\cdot \\Delta p_a - C_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EV</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recur</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">loss</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>recur</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{recur}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recur</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该故障类别在观察窗口内的复发概率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>loss</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{\\text{loss}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">loss</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单次复发造成的损失（用户影响分钟数、收入、SLO 预算烧损），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta p_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是这条行动项把复发概率压低的幅度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是实施成本。团队要解的是一个背包问题：在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum C_a \\le B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 的约束下最大化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mtext>EV</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum \\text{EV}(a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EV</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这个模型的实用价值不在于精确计算——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>recur</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{recur}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recur</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta p_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 几乎无法精确估计——而在于它强制回答一个问题：<strong>这条行动项到底在防止什么、值多少</strong>。答不上来的行动项，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>EV</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EV}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EV</span></span></span></span></span></span> 近似为零，却仍要占用容量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[事故复盘产出&lt;br/&gt;候选行动项池] --&gt; B{能对应到&lt;br/&gt;具体复发场景吗}&#10;  B -- 否 --&gt; C[丢弃或降级为&lt;br/&gt;观察项]&#10;  B -- 是 --&gt; D[估算 EV&lt;br/&gt;复发概率 x 损失 x 降幅 - 成本]&#10;  D --&gt; E{EV &gt; 0 且&lt;br/&gt;成本可承受}&#10;  E -- 否 --&gt; C&#10;  E -- 是 --&gt; F[分配优先级&lt;br/&gt;P0 / P1 / P2]&#10;  F --&gt; G[指定单一 owner&lt;br/&gt;+ 跟踪工单]&#10;  G --&gt; H[并入容量预算 B]&#10;  H --&gt; I[闭环跟踪&lt;br/&gt;到期 / 老化 / 关闭]&#10;  I --&gt; J[度量:闭环率&lt;br/&gt;老化中位数 / 复发率]&#10;  J --&gt; A\">graph TD\n  A[事故复盘产出&lt;br/&gt;候选行动项池] --&gt; B{能对应到&lt;br/&gt;具体复发场景吗}\n  B -- 否 --&gt; C[丢弃或降级为&lt;br/&gt;观察项]\n  B -- 是 --&gt; D[估算 EV&lt;br/&gt;复发概率 x 损失 x 降幅 - 成本]\n  D --&gt; E{EV &gt; 0 且&lt;br/&gt;成本可承受}\n  E -- 否 --&gt; C\n  E -- 是 --&gt; F[分配优先级&lt;br/&gt;P0 / P1 / P2]\n  F --&gt; G[指定单一 owner&lt;br/&gt;+ 跟踪工单]\n  G --&gt; H[并入容量预算 B]\n  H --&gt; I[闭环跟踪&lt;br/&gt;到期 / 老化 / 关闭]\n  I --&gt; J[度量:闭环率&lt;br/&gt;老化中位数 / 复发率]\n  J --&gt; A</pre><p>上面这张图刻意让「丢弃」成为一条正式路径。Google SRE 工作手册举过一个反例：把每条行动项都标成同样优先级，结果是「There&#39;s no way to determine which action to tackle first」——当所有事都重要，就无事可做。反例里的糟糕复盘只有一条行动项挂了跟踪工单（&quot;Only one action item was assigned a tracking bug&quot;），而优秀复盘里 17 条行动项<strong>每一条</strong>都同时有 owner 和跟踪编号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从待办列表到带优先级与所有者的工单\">从待办列表到带优先级与所有者的工单</h2><p>闭环的第一道关口是让行动项离开「散文」形态。Google SRE 工作手册的对比案例给了一份可照抄的模板：优秀复盘把 17 条行动项按五个主题分组（&quot;Grouping action items by theme makes it easier to assign owners and priorities&quot;），每条都带类型、优先级、owner 和跟踪工单号（BUG1234 至 BUG1247），优先级分布为 3 条 P0、5 条 P1、6 条 P2。类型划为 investigate、prevent、mitigate、detect、repair 五类——分类的意义是暴露偏科：如果一个团队的行动项几乎全是 mitigate 而极少 prevent，说明复盘只是把「下次救火更快」写进了计划，没有改变起火条件。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>必填</th>\n<th>缺失时的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单一 owner</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>无主行动项「less likely to be resolved」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跟踪工单号</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>行动项被遗忘，导致复发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优先级 P0/P1/P2</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>无法排序，等于没有优先级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型（prevent/detect/…）</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n<td>无法发现「只缓解不预防」的偏科</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>到期日 / SLA</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n<td>行动项无声老化，无告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可验证完成态</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>「改善」「优化」无法判定是否关闭</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关于 owner，Google 的经验是「Declaring official ownership results in accountability, which leads to action」，并偏好「It&#39;s better to have a single owner and multiple collaborators」——一个 owner 加多个协作者；共同负责在实践中等于无人负责。</p>\n<p>关于条数，两家给出的是不同方向的约束。PagerDuty 收紧到最高档：「Generally we only want to create things that are P0/P1&#39;s」；Google 的政策是用户可感中断的复盘「must have at least one P[01] bug associated with them」，例外极少。合起来的实操含义是：<strong>P0/P1 是必设的下限，P2 是可选的蓄水池，无止境堆积 P2 正是清单腐烂的开始</strong>。PagerDuty 还把「创建工单」和「完成工单」分开：复盘 owner「只负责创建工单，不负责跟进到解决」（&quot;You are only responsible for creating the tickets, not following them up to resolution&quot;），并用严重度与日期标签让工单可被批量聚合与老化分析（<a href=\"https://response.pagerduty.com/after/post_mortem_process/\">PagerDuty</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"闭环跟踪-状态-sla-与-老化-这一真正的信号\">闭环跟踪：状态、SLA 与「老化」这一真正的信号</h2><p>跟踪不是把工单建出来就结束。闭环跟踪要解决三件事：状态可判定、时间可度量、升级有触发条件。最简可用的状态机是 <code>Open → In Progress → Blocked → Closed</code>，并显式区分 Closed 的两种含义——「已完成」与「已决定不做」（wontfix，需带理由和决策人）。把 wontfix 并入 Closed 而不留痕，会让闭环率失真，等于鼓励用「假装关闭」刷数字。</p>\n<p>比状态更重要的是时间维度。PagerDuty 对复盘节奏给出了明确数字：SEV-1 的复盘会议须在<strong>3 个日历日内</strong>排期，SEV-2 在 <strong>5 个工作日内</strong>；复盘文档应在会前约 <strong>24 小时</strong>发到频道供反馈（<a href=\"https://response.pagerduty.com/after/post_mortem_process/\">PagerDuty</a>）。同样逻辑该延伸到行动项自身——为 P0/P1 设到期窗口（P0 一个迭代内、P1 一个季度内），并对<strong>逾期未关闭</strong>这一状态本身告警。闭环跟踪最有信息量的指标不是「闭环率」，而是<strong>老化分布</strong>：一批行动项的中位存活时长、以及存活超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 倍 SLA 的长尾。Google SRE 工作手册在诊断复发时建议追问两句：「Are action items taking too long to close?」以及「Are the right action items being captured in the first place?」（<a href=\"https://sre.google/workbook/postmortem-culture/\">Google SRE Workbook</a>）。前一句是闭环失效，后一句是选项失效——看板应同时能回答两问。Google 另有可借鉴的一招：每年两次 FixIt 周，集中清理积压行动项并对关闭最多者给予认可。</p>\n<p>闭环跟踪也应区分<strong>人驱动的动作</strong>与<strong>系统驱动的动作</strong>。Google 的经验是「Trying to change human behavior is less reliable than changing automated systems and processes」——把「加强培训」「提高警惕」当作行动项，追踪上看似关闭得很快（开完会即关），预防效果却最弱。这类项应被降级标注，并在度量中以不同权重处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"经济学-边际收益递减与复杂度税\">经济学：边际收益递减与复杂度税</h2><p>把行动项当投资组合，会自然遇到第一条曲线：<strong>同一起事故的第一条行动项收益最高，越往后越低</strong>。防止复发的最强手段（通常是根因修复）往往排在第一条；之后补充的检测、缓解、文档化，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta p_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 递减而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 未必下降，边际 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>EV</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EV}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EV</span></span></span></span></span></span> 走低。所以「复盘出了 30 条行动项」不是成就，更可能是把低价值项混进高价值项里，稀释了注意力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[根因修复&lt;br/&gt;高 Δp 高成本] --&gt; E[累计风险下降]&#10;  B[检测补强&lt;br/&gt;中 Δp 低成本] --&gt; E&#10;  C[缓解自动化&lt;br/&gt;中 Δp 中成本] --&gt; E&#10;  D[培训 / 文档&lt;br/&gt;低 Δp 低成本] --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F{继续加项?}&#10;  F -- 边际 EV 仍为正 --&gt; G[继续投入]&#10;  F -- 边际 EV 转负 --&gt; H[停止&lt;br/&gt;避免复杂度税]\">graph TD\n  A[根因修复&lt;br/&gt;高 Δp 高成本] --&gt; E[累计风险下降]\n  B[检测补强&lt;br/&gt;中 Δp 低成本] --&gt; E\n  C[缓解自动化&lt;br/&gt;中 Δp 中成本] --&gt; E\n  D[培训 / 文档&lt;br/&gt;低 Δp 低成本] --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F{继续加项?}\n  F -- 边际 EV 仍为正 --&gt; G[继续投入]\n  F -- 边际 EV 转负 --&gt; H[停止&lt;br/&gt;避免复杂度税]</pre><p>第二条曲线是<strong>复杂度税</strong>。事故分析师 Lorin Hochstein 在评论 GitHub 与 GCP 的公开复盘中反复指出：新增的自动化与防护「they all increase complexity!」，并解释「By increasing complexity, we eliminate known failure modes at the cost of introducing novel failure modes」（<a href=\"https://surfingcomplexity.blog/category/incidents/\">Surfing Complexity</a>）。每条新加的检查、门禁、自动回滚，都是未来故障的潜在来源；当机制本身的复杂度足以制造新的失效模式时，它的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>EV</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EV}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EV</span></span></span></span></span></span> 可能为负。这也解释了为什么 Google SRE 工作手册强调行动项要被服务技术负责人审阅批准（&quot;vetted and approved by the technical leads of the service&quot;）。</p>\n<p>Hochstein 还批评过把训练当行动项的做法：GCP 某次事故被归因于「两个人的人为错误，并把培训列为行动项」，他称之为「blame and train!」——这暴露的不是当事人失误，而是组织没有理解工作真实发生的方式。这类项的低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 正源于此：如果系统允许人在压力下犯这个错，培训只是提高了犯错的代价而非降低概率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反模式与度量-别让它变成工单坟场\">反模式与度量：别让它变成工单坟场</h2><p>闭环失败通常有一组可辨认的信号，识别它们比事后统计更有价值，因为它们在腐烂早期就出现。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>对应度量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>工单坟场</td>\n<td>大量创建、极少关闭、长期积压</td>\n<td>老化分布长尾、逾期率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优先级通胀</td>\n<td>全部标 P0，或全部不标</td>\n<td>P0 占比、无优先级项占比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无主行动项</td>\n<td>工单无 owner 或多人共担</td>\n<td>owner 覆盖率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>假性关闭</td>\n<td>用 wontfix 刷闭环率</td>\n<td>关闭类型分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只缓解不预防</td>\n<td>类型集中在 mitigate</td>\n<td>prevent 占比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空头行动项</td>\n<td>「加强」「改善」无法验证</td>\n<td>可验证完成态覆盖率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>度量层面值得长期跟踪的四个数字是：<strong>闭环率</strong>（按期关闭 / 总数）、<strong>老化中位数</strong>、<strong>复发率</strong>（同类故障在 N 个月内重现的比例）、<strong>类型分布</strong>（prevent 类占比）。其中复发率是唯一能证伪整套机制的指标——闭环率很高但复发率不降，说明关闭的是「容易关的」而非「能防住的」。闭环跟踪与上一章讨论的[事故时间线与上下文数据模型(../3_incident-tooling-automation/1_incident-timeline-context-data-model.md)是同一条数据链的两端：时间线记录事故里发生了什么，行动项跟踪记录事故后承诺了什么，两者共享同一套「带来源、可追溯」的记录纪律，才能把「我们承诺过要修」变成「我们修了没有、修了有没有用」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>行动项是<strong>投资组合</strong>而非清单：在容量约束下选 EV 最高的子集，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>EV</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>recur</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>loss</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EV}(a)=P_{\\text{recur}}\\cdot I_{\\text{loss}}\\cdot\\Delta p_a - C_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EV</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recur</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">loss</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，并让「丢弃」成为正式决策。</li>\n<li>每条行动项必备<strong>单一 owner + 跟踪工单 + 优先级</strong>；Google 的可照抄模板是 17 条按主题分组、P0/P1/P2 分层、全部挂工单号（BUG1234–1247）。</li>\n<li>条数约束取两家交集：<strong>P0/P1 必设</strong>（Google 要求用户可感中断至少有一条 P[01] 工单），P2 是可选蓄水池，避免堆积成坟场。</li>\n<li>闭环跟踪的核心是<strong>时间维度</strong>：设到期窗口、对逾期告警、看老化分布而非只看闭环率；PagerDuty 的节奏参照是 SEV-1 三个日历日、SEV-2 五个工作日排期复盘。</li>\n<li>记住两条经济曲线：行动项的<strong>边际收益递减</strong>，以及新增防护的<strong>复杂度税</strong>——「we eliminate known failure modes at the cost of introducing novel failure modes」。</li>\n<li>只跟踪可验证的完成态，并让<strong>复发率</strong>做最终证伪：闭环率高而复发率不降，说明关错了项。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"行动项经济学与闭环跟踪","id":"行动项经济学与闭环跟踪"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把复盘产出当成投资组合","id":"核心概念-把复盘产出当成投资组合"},{"level":2,"text":"从待办列表到带优先级与所有者的工单","id":"从待办列表到带优先级与所有者的工单"},{"level":2,"text":"闭环跟踪：状态、SLA 与「老化」这一真正的信号","id":"闭环跟踪-状态-sla-与-老化-这一真正的信号"},{"level":2,"text":"经济学：边际收益递减与复杂度税","id":"经济学-边际收益递减与复杂度税"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式与度量：别让它变成工单坟场","id":"反模式与度量-别让它变成工单坟场"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"无指责复盘与系统性归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/sre-incident-command-response/postmortem-learning-governance/blameless-postmortem-causal-model"},"next":{"title":"事故度量、审计与合规上报","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/sre-incident-command-response/postmortem-learning-governance/incident-metrics-audit-compliance"}}